meta {
  name: scan
}

docs {
  # Scans

  Run in order: 01 starts a scan of the whole library and stores its job ID.
  04 answers 204 if the scan was still running, 409 (SCAN_NOT_RUNNING) if it
  already finished. 05 starts an incremental scan, which only processes the
  files added or modified since their last scan.
}
